rse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja465:9.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja465:9.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja465:9.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja465:9.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja465:10.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja465:10.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja465:10.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja465:10.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja465:11.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja465:11.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja465:11.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja465:11.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja465:12.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja465:12.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja465:12.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja465:12.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja465:13.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja465:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja465:0.2": "Dvādasakanipāta ", "ja465:0.3": "Cūḷakuṇālavagga ", "ja465:0.4": "2. Bhaddasālajātaka ", "ja465:1.1": "“Kā tvaṁ suddhehi vatthehi, ", "ja465:1.2": "aghe vehāyasaṁ ṭhitā; ", "ja465:1.3": "Kena tyāssūni vattanti, ", "ja465:1.4": "kuto taṁ bhayamāgataṁ”. ", "ja465:2.1": "“Taveva deva vijite, ", "ja465:2.2": "bhaddasāloti maṁ vidū; ", "ja465:2.3": "Saṭṭhi vassasahassāni, ", "ja465:2.4": "tiṭṭhato pūjitassa me. ", "ja465:3.1": "Kārayantā nagarāni, ", "ja465:3.2": "agāre ca disampati; ", "ja465:3.3": "Vividhe cāpi pāsāde, ", "ja465:3.4": "na maṁ te accamaññisuṁ; ", "ja465:3.5": "Yatheva maṁ te pūjesuṁ, ", "ja465:3.6": "tatheva tvampi pūjaya”. ", "ja465:4.1": "“Taṁ ivāhaṁ na passāmi, ", "ja465:4.2": "thūlaṁ kāyena te dumaṁ; ", "ja465:4.3": "Ārohapariṇāhena, ", "ja465:4.4": "abhirūposi jātiyā. ", "ja465:5.1": "Pāsādaṁ kārayissāmi, ", "ja465:5.2": "ekatthambhaṁ manoramaṁ; ", "ja465:5.3": "Tattha taṁ upanessāmi, ", "ja465:5.4": "ciraṁ te yakkha jīvitaṁ”. ", "ja465:6.1": "“Evaṁ cittaṁ udapādi, ", "ja465:6.2": "sarīrena vinābhāvo; ", "ja465:6.3": "Puthuso maṁ vikantitvā, ", "ja465:6.4": "khaṇḍaso avakantatha. ", "ja465:7.1": "Agge ca chetvā majjhe ca, ", "ja465:7.2": "pacchā mūlamhi chindatha; ", "ja465:7.3": "Evaṁ me chijjamānassa, ", "ja465:7.4": "na dukkhaṁ maraṇaṁ siyā”. ", "ja465:8.1": "“Hatthapādaṁ yathā chinde, ", "ja465:8.2": "Kaṇṇanāsañca jīvato; ", "ja465:8.3": "Tato pacchā siro chinde, ", "ja465:8.4": "Taṁ dukkhaṁ maraṇaṁ siyā. ", "ja465:9.1": "Sukhaṁ nu khaṇḍaso chinnaṁ, ", "ja465:9.2": "bhaddasāla vanappati; ", "ja465:9.3": "Kiṁhetu kiṁ upādāya, ", "ja465:9.4": "khaṇḍaso chinnamicchasi”. ", "ja465:10.1": "“Yañca hetumupādāya, ", "ja465:10.2": "hetuṁ dhammūpasaṁhitaṁ; ", "ja465:10.3": "Khaṇḍaso chinnamicchāmi, ", "ja465:10.4": "mahārāja suṇohi me. ", "ja465:11.1": "Ñātī me sukhasaṁvaddhā, ", "ja465:11.2": "mama passe nivātajā; ", "ja465:11.3": "Tepihaṁ upahiṁseyyaṁ, ", "ja465:11.4": "paresaṁ asukhocitaṁ”. ", "ja465:12.1": "“Ceteyyarūpaṁ cetesi, ", "ja465:12.2": "bhaddasāla vanappati; ", "ja465:12.3": "Hitakāmosi ñātīnaṁ, ", "ja465:12.4": "abhayaṁ samma dammi te”ti. ", "ja465:13.1": "Bhaddasālajātakaṁ dutiyaṁ. "}, "variant_text": {"ja465:0.1": "", "ja465:0.2": "", "ja465:0.3": "", "ja465:0.4": "", "ja465:1.1": "", "ja465:1.2": "vehāyasaṁ ṭhitā → vehāsayaṁ ṭhitā (bj, pts-vp-pli1); vehāyasaṇṭhitā (sya1ed, sya2ed) ", "ja465:1.3": "", "ja465:1.4": "", "ja465:2.1": "", "ja465:2.2": "", "ja465:2.3": "Saṭṭhi → saṭṭhiṁ (bj, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja465:2.4": "", "ja465:3.1": "", "ja465:3.2": "", "ja465:3.3": "", "ja465:3.4": "", "ja465:3.5": "", "ja465:3.6": "", "ja465:4.1": "Taṁ ivāhaṁ → tava ahaṁ (bj); tañca ahaṁ (sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja465:4.2": "", "ja465:4.3": "", "ja465:4.4": "", "ja465:5.1": "", "ja465:5.2": "", "ja465:5.3": "", "ja465:5.4": "", "ja465:6.1": "", "ja465:6.2": "", "ja465:6.3": "", "ja465:6.4": "", "ja465:7.1": "", "ja465:7.2": "mūlamhi chindatha → mūlañca chindatha (bj); mūlaṁ vichindatha (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja465:7.3": "", "ja465:7.4": "", "ja465:8.1": "Hatthapādaṁ → hatthapāde (mr) | chinde → chinne (mr) ", "ja465:8.2": "jīvato → jīvite (bj, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja465:8.3": "", "ja465:8.4": "", "ja465:9.1": "", "ja465:9.2": "", "ja465:9.3": "", "ja465:9.4": "", "ja465:10.1": "", "ja465:10.2": "", "ja465:10.3": "", "ja465:10.4": "", "ja465:11.1": "", "ja465:11.2": "", "ja465:11.3": "", "ja465:11.4": "", "ja465:12.1": "Ceteyyarūpaṁ → cetabbarūpaṁ (bj, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja465:12.2": "", "ja465:12.3": "", "ja465:12.4": "", "ja465:13.1": ""}, "reference_text": {"ja465:0.1": "", "ja465:0.2": "", "ja465:0.3": "", "ja465:0.4": "", "ja465:1.1": "ms22J_2252, msdiv13, pts-vp-pli4.154", "ja465:1.2": "", "ja465:1.3": "", "ja465:1.4": "", "ja465:2.1": "ms22J_2253, msdiv14", "ja465:2.2": "", "ja465:2.3": "", "ja465:2.4": "", "ja465:3.1": "csp1ed22.243, csp2ed22.243, ms22J_2254, msdiv15, ndp22.235", "ja465:3.2": "", "ja465:3.3": "", "ja465:3.4": "", "ja465:3.5": "", "ja465:3.6": "", "ja465:4.1": "ms22J_2255, msdiv16, pts-vp-pli4.155", "ja465:4.2": "", "ja465:4.3": "", "ja465:4.4": "", "ja465:5.1": "ms22J_2256, msdiv17", "ja465:5.2": "", "ja465:5.3": "", "ja465:5.4": "", "ja465:6.1": "ms22J_2257, msdiv18", "ja465:6.2": "", "ja465:6.3": "", "ja465:6.4": "", "ja465:7.1": "bj30.416, dr27.323, ms22J_2258, msdiv19, pts-vp-pli4.156, sya27.325", "ja465:7.2": "", "ja465:7.3": "", "ja465:7.4": "", "ja465:8.1": "ms22J_2259, msdiv20", "ja465:8.2": "", "ja465:8.3": "", "ja465:8.4": "", "ja465:9.1": "ms22J_2260, msdiv21", "ja465:9.2": "", "ja465:9.3": "", "ja465:9.4": "", "ja465:10.1": "ms22J_2261, msdiv22", "ja465:10.2": "", "ja465:10.3": "", "ja465:10.4": "", "ja465:11.1": "ms22J_2262, msdiv23", "ja465:11.2": "", "ja465:11.3": "", "ja465:11.4": "", "ja465:12.1": "ms22J_2263, msdiv24, pts-vp-pli4.157, vri68.190", "ja465:12.2": "", "ja465:12.3": "", "ja465:12.4": "", "ja465:13.1": "ms22J_2264"}, "keys_order": ["ja465:0.1", "ja465:0.2", "ja465:0.3", "ja465:0.4", "ja465:1.1", "ja465:1.2", "ja465:1.3", "ja465:1.4", "ja465:2